  "_readme": "Model routing v6 (S17, owner 2026-10-29: Claude Opus 5.5 for every agent). Per agent: a default route plus optional per-locale overrides. Models come from src/ai/models.ts (npm run ai:models lists them; test/ai-models.test.ts checks this table against it). effort is mapped per provider (DeepSeek: low|high|max); Claude Opus 5.5 starts at medium, its own default. max_tokens leaves room for Claude's thinking, which counts toward it. ACTIVE_AI_MODEL=<id> in .env puts every route on one model, each max_tokens kept within its limit.",
